  <name>SquidServers</name>
  <summary>Simple local Minecraft server hosting</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      SquidServers makes creating, managing, and hosting local Minecraft servers effortless.
      Easily configure Vanilla, Paper, Fabric, Forge, and NeoForge servers with automated setup,
      performance metrics, and seamless world imports.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>One-click server creation with automatic Java runtime resolution</li>
      <li>Real-time server performance metrics and RAM allocation controls</li>
      <li>Automated player invite links and built-in network tunneling</li>
      <li>Complete world backups, imports, and modpack management</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

